#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/activation-functions.md:402
msgid "激活函数是神经网络**非线性表达能力**的来源："
msgstr "Activation functions are the source of **non-linear expressiveness** in neural networks:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/activation-functions.md:404
msgid "**几何视角**：每个激活函数定义了输入空间的划分方式"
msgstr "**Geometric perspective**: Each activation function defines how input space is partitioned"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/activation-functions.md:405
msgid "**梯度视角**：激活函数的导数决定了反向传播时的梯度流动"
msgstr "**Gradient perspective**: The derivative of an activation function determines gradient flow during backpropagation"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/activation-functions.md:406
msgid "**实践视角**："
msgstr "**Practical perspective**:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/activation-functions.md:407
msgid "ReLU是隐藏层的默认选择"
msgstr "ReLU is the default choice for hidden layers"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/activation-functions.md:408
msgid "Softmax是多分类输出的标准选择"
msgstr "Softmax is the standard choice for multi-class classification outputs"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/activation-functions.md:409
msgid "梯度消失问题推动了ReLU及其变体的发展"
msgstr "The vanishing gradient problem motivated the development of ReLU and its variants"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/activation-functions.md:411
