msgid ""
"理解{ref}`activation-functions`如何引入非线性后，我们将探讨{ref}`loss-"
"functions`——如何量化模型预测的好坏，将训练转化为可通过{ref}`gradient-descent`求解的优化问题。"
msgstr ""
"Having understood how {ref}`activation-functions` introduce non-linearity, we will explore {ref}`loss-functions`—how to quantify prediction quality and transform training into an optimization problem solvable via {ref}`gradient-descent`."

